==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Alpacky]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Maawth]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 76.67~80 seconds<sup>2,300f~2,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] is a great meatshield for this stage as it is mostly Alien enemies. Use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to exploit the Celeboodles for money and spam Catellite, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], and any good [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien Cats]] you have to deal with Crustaceous Scissorex. Ariant may seem threatening, but if you happen to have [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] you can easily kill them, or just kill them with sheer damage with the other Units such as Can Can Cat, [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] and Courier Cat. If you happen to have [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]], they can chip the Alpacky. Maglev Cat can also deal chip damage to Alpacky and Scissorex.

==='''Reccomended Ubers'''===
*[[Bliza (Uber Rare Cat)|Blizarena]] - Breaks the stage in half, with her resistance to Aliens making sure she will stay a long time on the field at high levels. Ariant will still consume her though.
*[[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Megaphrodite]] - Can deal lots of damage to most enemies in this stage, but she doesn't outrange Scissorex, so be careful when timing her.

